      ],
      "en": "Don’t rebuke an older man, but exhort him as a father; the younger men as brothers;",
      "ko": "늙은이를 꾸짖지 말고 권하되 아비에게 하듯하며 젊은이를 형제에게 하듯하고",
      "source_text_hash": "f9b1052387b5a135504177aa7ad92224f94682db66a827a7dc8568d4ed55f5ef",
      "translation_text_hash": "4038190f15f95e372ef88ad93babc420cb606da31bae55b8b28a31ac465488f0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "늙은이를 꾸짖지 말고 권하되 아비에게 하듯하며 젊은이를 형제에게 하듯하고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4038190f15f95e372ef88ad93babc420cb606da31bae55b8b28a31ac465488f0"
      ]
    },
    {
