      "en": "Also command these things, that they may be without reproach.",
      "ko": "네가 또한 이것을 명하여 그들로 책망 받을 것이 없게 하라",
      "source_text_hash": "36da79f6762950fcae4618cd85a1678388f7752dc4ee57e2f3373630249664ba",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8c0437a6aea4ec2092844b4d4811008127a03f230e0245b55785ad88277c615",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
