      "en": "having condemnation, because they have rejected their first pledge.",
      "ko": "처음 믿음을 저버렸으므로 심판을 받느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "84af682f62dfe7c1474b466e367c69da566e457e992083df3d4b28e8efa162a6",
      "translation_text_hash": "b7bcf18b625e06246bdb0d25c6618a4523f03e4f96b100df4162cf727184a41f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "처음 믿음을 저버렸으므로 심판을 받느니라"
      ],
